<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters 17th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 17th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Amsterdam Dutch guilder air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one. These rates are exclusive of cargo fuel surcharges being applied by airlines.</p>
<p>					NOV 22		  OCT 8</p>
<p>				     UNITED STATES</p>
<p> AMS-JFK			1.30		    1.05</p>
<p> AMS-LAX			2.10		    1.90</p>
<p> AMS-CHI			1.50		    1.15</p>
<p>				     ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> AMS-HKG			2.80		    2.60</p>
<p> AMS-SIN			2.50		    2.25</p>
<p> AMS-NRT			4.30		    4.20</p>
<p> AMS-TPE			2.60		    2.45</p>
<p> AMS-SEL			3.80		    3.65</p>
<p> AMS-KUL			2.45		    2.30</p>
<p>				     MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> AMS-DXB		     1.65		    1.65</p>
<p> AMS-BAH		     2.40		    2.20</p>
<p> AMS-MCT		     2.70		    2.50</p>
<p> AMS-AUH		     2.10		    1.90</p>
<p>				     LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> AMS-MEX		     3.80		    3.70</p>
<p> AMS-BOG		     3.70		    3.55</p>
<p> AMS-SCL(CHILE)	5.65		    5.55</p>
<p> AMS-SAO		     5.45		    5.00</p>
<p>					AFRICA</p>
<p> AMS-JNB		     4.30		    3.65</p>
<p> AMS-NBO		    2.45		    2.35</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Amsterdan Schiphol airport.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
